#. module: remotecontrol_scada_mula
#: model:remotecontrol,remotecontrol_help:remotecontrol_scada_mula.remotecontrol_scada_mula
msgid "Uses <strong>mysql-connector-python</strong> or <strong>pymysql</strong> library to connect to SCADA MariaDB databases."
msgstr "Utiliza la librería <strong>mysql-connector-python</strong> o <strong>pymysql</strong> para conectar a bases de datos MariaDB del SCADA."

